From 3e9d6ce8fed8bc3ee7e8e4d55a20150b6dee2c50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HampterDev <131729366+HampterDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:04:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Release the Lapine upgrade box after a failed upgrade

On a failed ZC_ACK_RANDOM_UPGRADE_ITEM result,
game_mode_zc_ack_random_upgrade_item looks up the Lapine synthesis
window (0x122) instead of the upgrade window (0x12e) before calling
lapine_upgrade_set_waiting. With only the upgrade box open, the normal
case, the box stays waiting with its button disabled until it is
closed. If a synthesis box were open, the call would write a LapineBox
through the LapineUpgradeBox layout. The 2022-04-06 executable has the
same lookup; the success branch already uses 0x12e.

Look up the upgrade window.

Validation: the new test_lapine_upgrade_result runs the extracted handler
for every combination of open windows with failing and successful
results; it fails without the fix. Release build without warnings; the
full behavioral suite passed on the completed series.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VaQB81YtRGLtH8zvfX7WTY
